{"id":130173338328676,"name":"Tornado Sandbox Game (DOM3)","desc":"\n*This game will NOT run well on low end devices.*\n\nTornado Sandbox Game was created by Claymaker225, FoundVulnez and Bomer. \n\nThroughout Tornado Sandbox Game, there are over 25 variants of tornadoes you can receive. Ranging from slow and weak, to powerful and rapid moving tornades. Though, there are MORE tornadoes to be added to the game so expected even more variants of tornadoes.\n\nClaymaker225 - Lead Developer / Owner, Programmer.\nFoundVulnez - Programmer.\nBomer - VFX, Vehicle Designer.","path":"/game/130173338328676-tornado-sandbox-game","slug":"130173338328676-tornado-sandbox-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2a62971ae8c4141a0a77ba6af38e479d7301d71a8dd9a196da1d4ae7f99679e3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cf369d7d4bfcb1fe046a1247356713aa/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":441,"visitor":8124495,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-04T23:37:04.569Z","creator":{"name":"Tornado Game's Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Tornado-Sandbox-Game-(DOM3)-map-delete-and-server-crasher-226938","_id":"6a7277a0a6c625559022fc3e","title":"map delete and server crasher","game":{"_id":"6a7277a0a6c625559022fc3d","gameId":130173338328676,"name":"Tornado Sandbox Game (DOM3)","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":130173338328676},"features":"crashes and deletes the map","tags":[],"script":"local Event = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):FindFirstChild(\"ResetMap\")\n\nif not Event then\n    print(\"ResetMap not found\")\n    return\nend\n\nwhile true do\n    for i = 1, 50 do\n        task.spawn(function()\n            pcall(function()\n                Event:FireServer()\n            end)\n        end)\n    end\n    task.wait()\nend","owner":{"_id":